WEBVTT

01:10.570 --> 01:12.238
Have you known all along…

01:14.324 --> 01:15.575
that I…

01:17.869 --> 01:19.204
approached you on purpose?

01:27.253 --> 01:28.088
Yes.

01:32.675 --> 01:33.676
Since when?

01:35.428 --> 01:39.015
How did you find out about the connection
between So-hee and me?

01:41.101 --> 01:43.770
I already knew
Yoon So-hee's body was in the mortuary.

01:46.189 --> 01:50.276
I saw a copy of your student ID
before giving you the prescription,

01:50.985 --> 01:52.487
and you were the same age as her.

01:53.530 --> 01:54.906
I figured you were friends.

01:56.825 --> 02:01.246
When you bolted out of the ER,
I decided to follow you.

02:03.456 --> 02:06.126
I'm an intern here. Yeah.

02:25.812 --> 02:28.481
SEOUL JOO GENERAL HOSPITAL

03:15.904 --> 03:16.905
I'm sorry.

03:17.572 --> 03:19.991
From the start,
I knew why you wished to use me.

03:21.618 --> 03:23.369
The hospital director's son.

03:27.040 --> 03:29.667
When I found everything out,
I knew I was the right man.

03:30.210 --> 03:31.461
As your headsman.

03:33.087 --> 03:33.922
So,

03:35.048 --> 03:37.050
I told myself that I'd be of good use,

03:38.968 --> 03:42.222
and that I'd come running
whenever you wanted to use me.

03:43.306 --> 03:44.724
Wherever it was,

03:45.475 --> 03:48.895
I wanted to get there
before your sense of guilt.

03:51.814 --> 03:52.982
But you left.

03:56.319 --> 03:58.947
Thank you for being my tutor
for all this time.

03:59.030 --> 04:01.157
I hope you'll become a great doctor.

04:02.200 --> 04:03.451
Is this our last lesson?

04:04.327 --> 04:05.161
Why?

04:06.412 --> 04:07.247
Back then,

04:08.748 --> 04:10.083
why did you leave me?

04:11.542 --> 04:15.255
You'd decided to use me.
That was the right thing to do.

04:16.130 --> 04:20.385
But I just couldn't figure out
why you gave up on using me.

04:22.220 --> 04:23.388
I've been curious.

04:27.350 --> 04:31.354
I heard about what happened
to your father from So-hee's mother.

04:32.689 --> 04:34.691
She told me her savior had passed away.

04:36.693 --> 04:41.030
So I was afraid So-hee's body
would be moved from the freezer.

04:42.865 --> 04:43.700
Then…

04:45.285 --> 04:49.789
I found out that the intern I saw
at the ER was the director's son.

04:53.126 --> 04:55.795
I thought that I'd found someone
to latch onto.

04:57.797 --> 04:59.299
So I approached you.

05:02.135 --> 05:03.720
Then I realized something.

05:05.638 --> 05:10.310
"How could I even think of doing
such a thing just because I'm a victim?"

05:13.604 --> 05:16.858
"This man's a victim too."

05:24.282 --> 05:25.616
That's a relief.

05:28.870 --> 05:31.622
I thought you left me
because I wasn't your type.

05:36.419 --> 05:37.420
Now…

05:40.256 --> 05:43.092
you really have no reason not to use me.

05:45.887 --> 05:47.055
If you refuse me…

05:50.600 --> 05:51.851
it'll be for love.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.438
Not revenge.

06:10.036 --> 06:10.870
Then…

06:14.040 --> 06:15.041
help me.

06:16.751 --> 06:17.919
Until the end.

06:24.050 --> 06:24.967
I'll serve you

06:26.886 --> 06:27.887
until the end.

06:55.248 --> 06:57.667
Your lips that laughed
at others' misfortune,

06:57.750 --> 07:00.378
they've finally fallen silent
now the misfortune is yours.

07:00.878 --> 07:02.922
YOU FUCKING BITCH!

07:03.673 --> 07:08.010
The scar will itch, sting,
and burn all the time.

07:09.178 --> 07:10.012
It did for me.

07:23.526 --> 07:25.278
Do you know why I'm taking revenge?

07:26.529 --> 07:29.949
Over the last 18 years,
you had all forgotten about me.

07:31.033 --> 07:33.035
That's why. So that you'd remember.

07:34.287 --> 07:38.624
Now, you also want
to be remembered, don't you?

07:41.252 --> 07:44.005
Yeon-jin is almost done for. As for Sa-ra,

07:44.505 --> 07:48.301
I took care of her easily, thanks to you.
So my schedule's free.

07:48.801 --> 07:51.804
If you want to take revenge, tell me.
I'll help you.

07:52.972 --> 07:56.100
Don't you want to get back at Jae-jun?

08:25.630 --> 08:27.298
YOU WERE INSIDE?

08:31.344 --> 08:33.471
I CAME TO GET MY THINGS

08:34.805 --> 08:35.890
Yeah, I was inside.

08:37.683 --> 08:38.935
Take everything you need.

08:57.787 --> 08:59.539
Jae-jun is suffering from glaucoma,

08:59.622 --> 09:03.000
so he uses an eye drop once a day
to lower his intraocular pressure.

09:03.501 --> 09:05.628
But we often hear about accidents

09:06.128 --> 09:10.174
of windshield washer fluid
or hand sanitizer getting in one's eyes.

09:10.675 --> 09:14.011
What's important is
that Jae-jun won't be able to see

09:14.762 --> 09:18.516
redhead models,
auto-show girls, or Yeon-jin

09:19.559 --> 09:20.977
with his eyes again.

09:26.399 --> 09:27.483
What do you think?

09:28.943 --> 09:29.860
Do you want it?

09:40.079 --> 09:42.498
FOR REDUCING INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE

09:46.210 --> 09:47.211
You need more time?

09:49.463 --> 09:51.007
I have to shower before I leave.

09:52.341 --> 09:54.927
Oh, sorry. I keep forgetting.

09:55.428 --> 09:56.929
You can't reply, can you?

09:57.013 --> 09:58.097
Then clap instead.

09:58.764 --> 09:59.599
Ten minutes.

10:00.683 --> 10:01.851
Twenty minutes.

10:04.645 --> 10:06.772
Wow, you're good at sign language already.

10:07.440 --> 10:08.691
I understand everything.

10:09.984 --> 10:10.901
Ten minutes it is.

11:05.748 --> 11:06.666
Shit.

11:09.251 --> 11:10.586
You crazy fuckers!

11:17.593 --> 11:18.427
What's going on?

11:19.261 --> 11:20.680
I heard this motel was sold.

11:21.931 --> 11:25.810
We deserve severance pay, sir.
After all the messes we cleaned up.

11:26.686 --> 11:27.603
How much is it?

11:29.271 --> 11:30.106
How much?

11:32.483 --> 11:33.567
"Severance pay"?

11:34.985 --> 11:38.155
Why don't you ask me to pay
for your insurance too?

11:40.574 --> 11:41.534
What else?

11:42.034 --> 11:43.744
Do you need paternity leave?

11:53.879 --> 11:54.880
Goddamn it!

12:04.223 --> 12:05.558
You son of a bitch.

12:09.478 --> 12:10.980
It's days like today, right?

12:12.773 --> 12:13.774
When it rains.

12:16.777 --> 12:18.404
The evidence will get lost,

12:19.363 --> 12:21.490
and it will be easier to dig a hole.

12:47.433 --> 12:49.393
PARK YEON-JIN

12:49.477 --> 12:51.729
Don't hurry or rush

12:51.812 --> 12:54.398
Look cool when you come to me

12:56.692 --> 12:59.028
My heart is blazing with love

13:00.738 --> 13:01.572
VIDEO

13:01.655 --> 13:03.824
The never-ending dance…

13:37.525 --> 13:38.442
Hey!

14:35.416 --> 14:37.334
The NFS presumed the murder weapon

14:37.418 --> 14:39.712
to be a round object
with a big surface area.

14:40.546 --> 14:41.630
I think this is it.

14:42.381 --> 14:44.008
But this doesn't make sense.

14:44.508 --> 14:46.135
The evidence was just sitting here.

14:47.636 --> 14:51.390
All the security cameras are blank.
Apparently, the owner took the computer.

14:52.266 --> 14:53.934
That doesn't make sense either!

14:55.185 --> 14:57.229
But how did you learn about this place?

14:57.897 --> 14:59.148
An anonymous tip.

15:14.955 --> 15:16.540
Ye-sol, Uncle Jae-jun's here!

15:18.626 --> 15:19.543
Ye-sol, it's Uncle--

15:21.128 --> 15:22.880
No, it's Daddy. Daddy's here.

15:23.714 --> 15:25.132
Didn't know that, did you?

15:26.508 --> 15:28.844
I'm your real dad.
I'll explain everything.

15:29.345 --> 15:30.387
I even bought…

15:32.640 --> 15:34.516
Samsung Electronics and Kakao stocks!

15:34.600 --> 15:35.684
Excuse me.

15:36.644 --> 15:39.980
Ye-sol isn't here. That's Sae-mi.

15:41.190 --> 15:44.693
I heard Ye-sol transferred schools
to study overseas.

15:45.778 --> 15:46.612
Overseas?

15:49.949 --> 15:52.117
Ha Do-yeong, that motherfucker.

15:52.201 --> 15:53.869
Why are you telling me that now?

15:56.997 --> 15:59.792
HA DO YEO NG

16:02.294 --> 16:03.671
The number you have dialed…

16:03.754 --> 16:04.713
Damn it!

16:11.387 --> 16:12.638
Where is Ye-sol?

16:13.555 --> 16:16.058
Where is my daughter?
Where are you hiding her?

16:16.141 --> 16:17.893
I've always been curious, Jae-jun,

16:17.977 --> 16:20.646
about whose face you will get to see last.

16:21.563 --> 16:24.566
I guess now we know
that it won't be your daughter's.

16:24.650 --> 16:25.567
Where are you?

16:26.151 --> 16:28.737
Where are you right now?
You fucking bitch!

16:33.909 --> 16:34.994
Shit.

16:38.914 --> 16:40.582
Where is this Building B?

16:59.893 --> 17:01.979
What the fuck's wrong with my eyes?

17:02.479 --> 17:03.814
Aw, fuck…

17:04.314 --> 17:05.399
My eyes.

17:13.449 --> 17:14.908
You recognize her, don't you?

17:17.494 --> 17:19.413
-It's Yeon-jin's mother.
-Yes.

17:19.496 --> 17:20.497
Ms. Hong Yeong-ae.

17:21.248 --> 17:23.417
She hit someone while driving recently.

17:23.500 --> 17:26.170
The case was closed
as a simple car accident,

17:26.670 --> 17:29.423
but her cell phone records showed

17:29.506 --> 17:31.800
that she was being blackmailed
by the victim.

17:33.135 --> 17:35.345
"I know that your daughter
killed somebody."

17:38.474 --> 17:41.226
Why are you telling me this?

17:42.728 --> 17:44.354
I thought you'd know about it.

17:45.147 --> 17:48.567
I think you are the one
who gave that information to Lee Seok-jae.

17:49.401 --> 17:52.154
But I couldn't find any connection
between you and Lee.

17:52.237 --> 17:54.823
Then I looked into
his wife's call history.

17:55.741 --> 17:56.658
Kang Hyeon-nam.

17:57.409 --> 17:58.827
Don't you know who that is?

18:03.582 --> 18:05.000
The thing is, Detective,

18:05.918 --> 18:09.338
let's say I have a big mouth,
and I said something

18:10.339 --> 18:13.008
to him or his wife.

18:13.675 --> 18:15.094
Is that illegal?

18:16.345 --> 18:18.430
After all, she was the one driving.

18:21.183 --> 18:22.518
No, it's not illegal.

18:28.857 --> 18:30.192
Then what happens

18:31.235 --> 18:32.319
to Ms. Hong now?

18:35.280 --> 18:37.866
I have to go to the police station
where your daughter is.

18:37.950 --> 18:38.826
You moron!

18:38.909 --> 18:41.245
I'm in this mess
'cause you couldn't do your damn job!

18:41.328 --> 18:43.247
Was it that hard to get her to settle?

18:43.330 --> 18:44.164
Gosh!

18:45.749 --> 18:47.835
Aren't you home? Excuse me, ma'am!

18:47.918 --> 18:49.503
Are you really not there?

18:50.504 --> 18:53.465
Hey! Are you in there or not?
Hey! Come out!

18:54.341 --> 18:55.509
Ms. Hong.

19:06.395 --> 19:07.980
She just got arrested.

19:09.231 --> 19:10.232
For murder.

19:22.244 --> 19:23.662
Is this how this game ends?

19:25.164 --> 19:26.874
You arranged it all, didn't you?

19:27.958 --> 19:29.168
Even the anonymous tip.

19:39.928 --> 19:40.929
Thank you

19:42.681 --> 19:45.684
for listening to me all this time.

19:54.693 --> 19:57.946
It was only right that I did.
Although I'm 18 years late.

20:01.033 --> 20:02.618
This investigation is now over.

20:04.620 --> 20:06.997
Goodbye, then.

20:10.834 --> 20:11.668
Oh.

20:12.544 --> 20:14.296
I've gotten really busy,

20:14.796 --> 20:17.507
so I don't have time
to dedicate to other things.

20:29.686 --> 20:31.146
DIVORCE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT

20:58.340 --> 20:59.925
I suggest you get good lawyers.

21:01.343 --> 21:03.929
You can save money
on everything else in life,

21:04.763 --> 21:05.931
but not on lawyers.

21:09.476 --> 21:11.645
You're so cruel.

21:14.064 --> 21:16.441
How could you come in person
to serve the divorce papers?

21:22.531 --> 21:23.699
Where are you off to?

21:25.993 --> 21:28.245
I won't follow you, don't worry.

21:31.039 --> 21:32.040
The UK.

21:33.250 --> 21:34.835
Ye-sol likes soccer, you know.

21:38.547 --> 21:39.715
If I write…

21:41.967 --> 21:43.802
will you give Ye-sol my letters?

21:48.557 --> 21:49.725
Look after yourself.

22:31.600 --> 22:34.478
The registration transfer form
is in the car.

22:35.562 --> 22:37.731
Ms. Moon asked me to give it to you.

22:38.482 --> 22:40.067
She's grateful for all you've done.

22:41.610 --> 22:42.819
She wants you to have it

22:43.820 --> 22:45.947
and use it
to discover lots of nice places.

22:47.824 --> 22:50.077
Where did Dong-eun go?

22:50.660 --> 22:53.955
She said she's leaving it to someone
who will put it to good use.

22:58.710 --> 23:01.713
Whether you donate it
or use it to open a counseling center,

23:02.214 --> 23:04.299
she will support your decision.

23:05.467 --> 23:07.677
She also hopes
you'll get yourself some nice food.

23:08.970 --> 23:10.472
Ms. Moon told me

23:12.432 --> 23:15.602
to tell you that she was very grateful.

23:16.186 --> 23:17.854
Did Dong-eun leave?

23:19.898 --> 23:21.066
Where did she go?

23:54.850 --> 23:55.684
Hello?

23:56.184 --> 23:58.854
Do you want to go see the ocean with me?

24:01.690 --> 24:03.692
That's the oldest line in the book.

24:08.613 --> 24:11.908
You can play music if you want.
Or you can sleep if you're tired.

24:11.992 --> 24:14.286
Oh, and look at my face once in a while.

24:14.995 --> 24:18.165
I look my best
from the passenger seat's angle.

24:21.209 --> 24:22.961
I don't have any songs on my phone.

24:23.587 --> 24:24.754
You can sing instead.

24:24.838 --> 24:26.673
Wow, finally.

24:27.674 --> 24:29.259
You'll be surprised, seriously.

24:34.389 --> 24:36.725
You're silent like the moonlight

24:36.808 --> 24:38.894
Who are you?

24:38.977 --> 24:41.021
You're bright like the sunlight

24:41.104 --> 24:43.690
Who are you?

24:43.773 --> 24:47.944
Whose love led you here to stand

24:48.028 --> 24:52.073
Where you are now?

24:52.574 --> 24:53.909
Is that how birds sing?

24:54.493 --> 24:57.954
Right now, I'm a falcon instead of a bird.
You know, that band?

24:58.038 --> 25:02.542
Those bright eyes of yours
Shine a ray of light

25:02.626 --> 25:06.338
On my lonely heart

25:06.922 --> 25:11.426
Those small lips of yours provide comfort

25:11.510 --> 25:15.514
To my lonely heart

25:55.387 --> 25:56.721
Know any other songs?

25:58.473 --> 25:59.891
Stop, please stop.

26:00.475 --> 26:02.143
-Any other songs?
-Try singing it.

26:02.227 --> 26:03.395
-No way.
-Just once.

26:03.478 --> 26:04.813
-No.
-Please, just once!

26:13.071 --> 26:15.407
I bought the beer.
Do you need anything else?

26:16.533 --> 26:18.118
We're at the final destination.

26:20.662 --> 26:21.997
This is the end.

26:24.207 --> 26:25.208
Goodbye.

27:10.253 --> 27:12.088
What took you so long?

27:15.175 --> 27:16.926
I missed you so much.

27:17.010 --> 27:18.011
Same here.

27:19.262 --> 27:22.349
I really wanted to see you like this.

27:24.601 --> 27:26.102
Completely alone.

27:26.978 --> 27:28.938
Not a friend in the world.

27:29.022 --> 27:30.231
No one to love you.

27:33.234 --> 27:34.235
Do you think…

27:36.071 --> 27:37.572
I'll be in here for long?

27:37.656 --> 27:39.240
Yes, I do.

27:40.200 --> 27:42.202
Even if you do get out, you'll be so old--

27:42.285 --> 27:43.286
You fucking bitch!

27:43.370 --> 27:46.039
Inmate 2695! Quiet down.

27:51.836 --> 27:53.588
I hope that, in the end,

27:54.923 --> 27:57.092
whether I'm in the world or not,

27:58.259 --> 28:00.345
your world will be full of me.

28:02.681 --> 28:07.310
I want you to resent every moment
of your life so much that you feel it

28:08.812 --> 28:09.896
deep in your bones.

28:15.694 --> 28:16.611
I am resentful.

28:18.613 --> 28:20.699
I could've gotten away with it.

28:21.574 --> 28:22.909
Of course I'm resentful.

28:24.577 --> 28:25.578
But you know what?

28:30.375 --> 28:32.377
I should be the one saying that to you.

28:34.546 --> 28:35.630
Why would you?

28:38.007 --> 28:39.509
Why should I be resentful?

29:54.793 --> 29:55.960
Kim Gyeong-ran…

29:58.463 --> 30:00.048
You're in there, aren't you?

30:01.049 --> 30:02.383
You're in there, right?

30:10.058 --> 30:12.227
Hey, Gyeong-ran…

30:13.978 --> 30:17.732
Oh fuck, please. Please help me.

30:18.316 --> 30:23.029
Can you get my phone?

30:25.532 --> 30:28.701
Help me, you fucking bitch!

30:31.037 --> 30:31.871
Let go!

30:32.580 --> 30:33.498
Let go.

30:34.958 --> 30:36.209
Stop it.

30:36.292 --> 30:37.377
Let me go!

30:37.460 --> 30:39.712
Don't fucking play coy.

30:41.589 --> 30:44.425
You don't like mine?
Fuck, I know you like it.

30:44.509 --> 30:45.760
-Be honest!
-Let me go!

30:45.844 --> 30:46.928
Let go!

30:49.097 --> 30:51.516
Let go, you son of a bitch!

31:21.296 --> 31:22.797
It's me, Kim Gyeong-ran.

31:23.965 --> 31:26.467
Please help me, Dong-eun.

31:28.011 --> 31:29.429
You told me

31:30.388 --> 31:32.140
that Yeon-jin has to be the killer.

31:33.933 --> 31:34.767
I'm

31:36.394 --> 31:37.562
so scared.

31:40.231 --> 31:41.649
Help me, Dong-eun.

31:42.901 --> 31:43.818
What do I

31:45.278 --> 31:46.446
do with this?

31:50.491 --> 31:52.493
This should go back where it was.

31:53.077 --> 31:56.497
Don't worry. Yeon-jin is the killer.
That doesn't change.

32:00.335 --> 32:01.336
Thank you

32:02.921 --> 32:04.005
for helping me.

32:05.715 --> 32:06.549
And

32:08.009 --> 32:09.010
about what I did…

32:13.932 --> 32:15.266
I'm really sorry.

32:16.267 --> 32:17.101
Dong-eun.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.858
I'm not helping you.

32:25.026 --> 32:27.362
No matter where you are
or what you're doing,

32:28.488 --> 32:30.114
you should bear this much burden.

32:30.782 --> 32:31.616
Also,

32:32.867 --> 32:35.870
I'm not standing in that hallway anymore.

32:36.871 --> 32:38.414
You shouldn't have to either.

32:39.666 --> 32:42.835
Don't stand in that gym anymore.

33:06.234 --> 33:08.319
What? What is it?

33:09.904 --> 33:11.406
Why should I be resentful?

33:11.489 --> 33:13.992
Inmate 2695! Your visit is over.

33:21.499 --> 33:23.543
I'm resentful too.

33:24.460 --> 33:27.547
Look at you. God isn't on my side.

33:28.673 --> 33:30.049
Just a criminal punishment?

33:31.134 --> 33:32.552
So I have no other choice

33:33.845 --> 33:36.055
but to hope this prison becomes your hell.

33:37.181 --> 33:39.434
All I can do is pray

33:40.351 --> 33:42.520
that you live a long life in this hell,

33:43.229 --> 33:44.731
never knowing why.

33:45.857 --> 33:49.027
What is it? What don't I know?

33:49.110 --> 33:50.695
-Hey, Moon Dong-eun!
-Come here!

33:50.778 --> 33:54.449
You bitch. I'm going to fucking kill you,
you fucking bitch!

33:54.532 --> 33:57.869
Let go! You fucking bitch!

33:58.369 --> 34:00.121
-Let go!
-Come out!

34:00.204 --> 34:01.789
Let go!

34:01.873 --> 34:03.875
I'll kill you, fucking bitch!

34:04.917 --> 34:06.085
Let me do that.

34:09.464 --> 34:10.715
I'll be the one

34:12.050 --> 34:13.051
who kills me.

34:15.219 --> 34:16.387
So, for us,

34:17.513 --> 34:20.266
it's time to say goodbye.

34:25.980 --> 34:28.649
Dear Yeon-jin,
whom I've always dreamed of killing,

34:30.568 --> 34:31.444
goodbye.

34:32.945 --> 34:36.949
This is my last letter to you.

34:39.368 --> 34:42.038
I bid everyone else farewell as well.

34:43.873 --> 34:45.792
I hope it burned for you too,

34:47.001 --> 34:48.252
like it did for me.

34:50.296 --> 34:52.381
I hope that it was painful.

36:00.366 --> 36:01.450
Help!

36:02.827 --> 36:03.828
Please help me!

36:07.582 --> 36:09.333
Please save my son!

36:14.505 --> 36:16.841
I'm Yeo-jeong's mother.

36:21.554 --> 36:23.681
If this is the end you were preparing for,

36:24.599 --> 36:25.933
then you should already know.

36:28.352 --> 36:29.520
What if…

36:31.647 --> 36:33.566
Yeo-jeong chooses this end too?

36:38.696 --> 36:40.281
I met with So-hee's mother.

36:41.490 --> 36:44.660
And she told me about you.

36:45.953 --> 36:48.372
She told me where you came from,

36:49.207 --> 36:51.209
and how you ended up where you are now.

36:52.877 --> 36:55.254
But this isn't the way
you should end things.

36:59.926 --> 37:02.470
When Yeo-jeong said
he wanted to help you get revenge,

37:02.553 --> 37:04.138
I gave him my permission.

37:05.056 --> 37:06.891
So, please give me your permission

37:07.391 --> 37:10.394
to save your life today.

37:13.648 --> 37:16.484
Whether I have to hang on to you
or jump with you,

37:16.567 --> 37:18.861
I'm going to save you no matter what! So…

37:22.907 --> 37:25.493
I need you to help my son escape his hell

37:26.327 --> 37:27.328
so that

37:29.163 --> 37:30.831
he will choose to live.

37:32.750 --> 37:33.751
I'm begging you.

37:44.595 --> 37:46.222
Is Kang Yeong-cheon

37:47.265 --> 37:48.849
Yeo-jeong's hell?

37:51.644 --> 37:55.481
Is 3724 his inmate number?

37:59.443 --> 38:00.361
That's right.

38:03.197 --> 38:04.865
That disgusting bastard!

38:13.874 --> 38:17.878
Even now, what happened that day
is as vivid as yesterday in my memory.

38:18.879 --> 38:21.340
The scent of blood in my nostrils.

38:22.091 --> 38:25.511
The cutting noises that the knife made
when it pierced his neck.

38:26.887 --> 38:29.473
The temperature of the blood
that ran down my hands.

38:29.557 --> 38:32.643
And even his last, flickering gaze.

38:32.727 --> 38:35.479
Dad!

38:36.230 --> 38:38.357
-Bring the cart, hurry!
-Dad!

38:38.441 --> 38:39.734
Dad!

38:40.234 --> 38:42.570
Dad!

38:42.653 --> 38:43.738
Dad?

38:45.281 --> 38:47.700
Dad!

38:48.284 --> 38:51.912
Dad!

38:51.996 --> 38:53.831
He said, "Dad"!

38:53.914 --> 38:57.001
Wake up, Dad! Bring Mommy!

38:57.835 --> 39:00.463
The defendant has been indicted
for three counts of murder

39:00.546 --> 39:04.425
in addition to the desecration
and disposal of corpses.

39:05.176 --> 39:09.180
Based on the evidence that has been
brought forth by the investigation,

39:09.263 --> 39:13.684
the court finds the defendant guilty
of all the charges.

39:14.268 --> 39:17.521
Also, the defendant murdered the doctor

39:17.605 --> 39:20.441
who was providing him
with medical treatment,

39:20.524 --> 39:21.692
against moral principles.

39:22.193 --> 39:24.612
Not only did his actions have
serious consequences

39:24.695 --> 39:27.740
but the method by which the crime
was committed was very cruel.

39:28.240 --> 39:32.286
As a result, the court
has decided on a sentence.

39:34.080 --> 39:34.914
Verdict.

39:36.540 --> 39:38.376
The defendant is sentenced to death.

39:40.544 --> 39:44.215
The items that fall under Articles 1 to 3
will be confiscated.

39:54.141 --> 39:55.393
You son of a bitch!

39:57.561 --> 39:58.479
Yeo-jeong!

39:58.562 --> 40:00.898
You call yourself a human, you asshole?

40:01.482 --> 40:02.525
You dare laugh?

40:02.608 --> 40:08.406
I always admired the look a person gave
as the light drained from their eyes.

40:09.490 --> 40:13.494
The blood vessels in the eyes burst
and slowly color the whites of the eyes.

40:13.577 --> 40:14.912
Just like the sunset.

40:17.081 --> 40:18.999
I promise I'll write again.

40:31.512 --> 40:34.140
Have a restful weekend, Dr. Joo Yeo-jeong.

40:48.279 --> 40:51.240
SIX MONTHS LATER

40:51.323 --> 40:54.326
SUMMER OF 2023

41:30.070 --> 41:30.905
Mom.

41:31.989 --> 41:32.823
-Mom!
-Inmate!

41:32.907 --> 41:35.576
-No talking. Keep your mouth shut!
-Mom!

41:35.659 --> 41:37.328
-Mom!
-Inmate 3886! Face the wall!

41:37.411 --> 41:38.412
Mom!

41:38.954 --> 41:41.332
Mom!

41:42.082 --> 41:44.919
Mom!

41:56.263 --> 41:59.350
Hey, pretty face.
What's the weather like tomorrow?

42:00.267 --> 42:01.101
Huh?

42:13.781 --> 42:17.368
The weather has been cool for a few days
due to frequent rain showers.

42:17.451 --> 42:20.120
But from tomorrow,
the temperature will warm up,

42:20.204 --> 42:23.207
reaching close to 30 degrees Celsius
by midday.

42:23.290 --> 42:25.334
I recommend you wear light clothes

42:25.417 --> 42:27.711
and stay hydrated.

42:31.757 --> 42:34.843
Although we expect clear skies
and clean air,

42:35.344 --> 42:38.681
the ozone level
and the UV index will be high.

42:39.723 --> 42:44.061
Try to stay out of the sun
between 2:00 p.m. and 5:00 p.m…

42:46.480 --> 42:49.400
when the ozone level is at its highest.

42:49.984 --> 42:51.402
I'm Park Yeon-jin.

42:51.902 --> 42:54.405
Why is the weather so sad?

43:16.927 --> 43:21.348
I thought you wouldn't last a month,
but I was wrong. Has it been six months?

43:22.933 --> 43:23.851
Yes.

43:24.476 --> 43:26.145
It's summer already.

43:27.646 --> 43:29.773
I looked into that bitch and that bastard.

43:30.274 --> 43:31.942
You were right, Ms. Moon.

43:33.777 --> 43:35.613
Thank you for soothing my rage.

43:36.697 --> 43:40.284
But I know nothing's free in this world.

43:42.161 --> 43:45.080
Now tell me why you're sticking around.

43:49.209 --> 43:50.628
I have a favor to ask you.

43:51.253 --> 43:54.006
There's a prisoner serving life
at Cheongsong Prison.

43:57.384 --> 44:00.888
Normally, prisoners are sorted
into tiers from S1 to S5.

44:01.639 --> 44:03.891
S4 prisoners go to Cheongsong Prison.

44:07.061 --> 44:10.481
He must be a deplorable,
lawless piece of shit.

44:10.564 --> 44:11.398
Yes.

44:11.899 --> 44:14.401
Two of the three murder victims
were women.

44:16.028 --> 44:18.697
Can he be transferred to another prison?

44:23.077 --> 44:25.579
You'd need to stir up trouble
at the prison for that.

44:28.666 --> 44:31.585
There's only one place
that's worse than Cheongsong Prison.

44:32.086 --> 44:33.504
Jisan Prison.

44:35.339 --> 44:36.757
Will that place do?

44:46.767 --> 44:48.268
Find me if you ever need a loan.

44:48.352 --> 44:50.938
For you, I won't take
any interest in advance.

44:51.021 --> 44:51.855
You never know.

46:49.306 --> 46:50.641
I bought beer.

47:05.113 --> 47:06.448
Have you been well?

47:09.076 --> 47:10.160
What did you say?

47:13.288 --> 47:14.164
You're such a…

47:18.335 --> 47:19.253
horrible…

47:23.590 --> 47:25.175
How could you…

47:29.847 --> 47:30.931
Do you know…

47:33.308 --> 47:34.142
how much…

47:35.519 --> 47:36.854
I've missed you.

47:43.819 --> 47:46.154
Then why did you leave me again?

47:51.034 --> 47:52.828
Maybe it was out of love,

47:52.911 --> 47:54.454
not revenge.

48:06.466 --> 48:07.301
I…

48:10.596 --> 48:11.680
haven't been well.

48:15.726 --> 48:16.810
My revenge…

48:19.479 --> 48:20.981
didn't go as I planned.

48:25.986 --> 48:27.613
I think you need a tutor.

48:28.405 --> 48:31.658
Would you like me to give you lessons…
in revenge?

48:41.585 --> 48:43.837
I'll be your headsman now.

48:44.755 --> 48:47.174
I'll be your missing 1%.

48:48.258 --> 48:49.259
Tell me.

48:50.344 --> 48:52.220
Who do you want me to kill first?

48:58.852 --> 49:01.855
Since this is your first time,
you get the black stone.

49:03.690 --> 49:05.359
Let me place the stone on the board.

49:38.350 --> 49:40.560
EDEN APARTMENTS
ROOM 301 AVAILABLE FOR RENT

49:40.644 --> 49:42.062
I'm sorry I didn't say goodbye.

49:43.146 --> 49:44.982
You can put the room up for rent.

49:46.400 --> 49:50.654
I know now why Room 301
was cheaper than the others

49:51.655 --> 49:52.906
in the neighborhood.

49:54.491 --> 49:57.327
I remember everything now.

49:59.913 --> 50:01.581
Took you long enough.

50:03.083 --> 50:05.085
I knew from the moment I saw you.

51:08.148 --> 51:11.485
Oh, kid. Are you okay with your bare feet?

51:12.819 --> 51:15.989
Gosh, why are you wearing
a sweater, of all things?

51:16.073 --> 51:18.075
It's heavy when it gets wet.

51:18.158 --> 51:21.161
You're the reason
I'm in this mess, Grandma!

51:21.244 --> 51:23.121
My goodness, I can't believe you.

51:23.622 --> 51:24.873
You're blaming me?

51:24.956 --> 51:28.502
I saw you taking off your shoes
and going into the water.

51:29.753 --> 51:31.088
But, kid,

51:31.755 --> 51:34.424
the water is way too cold, isn't it?

51:34.925 --> 51:36.593
I'm freezing.

51:38.345 --> 51:39.221
Let's

51:40.472 --> 51:42.682
die when the spring comes.

51:43.517 --> 51:44.351
In spring.

52:01.618 --> 52:02.619
It's okay.

52:10.836 --> 52:12.921
There was a time when I used to think,

52:14.381 --> 52:16.383
"What if anybody, or anything,

52:17.801 --> 52:20.053
had tried to help me?"

52:23.431 --> 52:27.352
Eighteen springs have passed since then.

52:28.854 --> 52:30.355
Now I finally realize

52:32.149 --> 52:35.569
that there were good grown-ups
around me too.

52:36.570 --> 52:40.574
Friends, weather,
and divine intervention too.

52:41.324 --> 52:43.493
Is she the lady who had
the best admission portfolio?

52:43.577 --> 52:46.037
Yeah. And what's more,
I heard she's a nonmajor.

52:46.538 --> 52:48.206
Did you see her arm though?

52:55.046 --> 52:58.300
And that when you said
we should die in the spring,

52:59.301 --> 53:01.720
you meant we should bloom in the spring.

53:03.638 --> 53:07.809
Thank you very much for saving me.

53:09.477 --> 53:11.396
I didn't grow up to be a good person.

53:12.564 --> 53:16.067
But one day, one spring,

53:17.027 --> 53:18.695
I will fully bloom.

53:20.363 --> 53:22.532
I wish you a long, healthy life.

53:24.701 --> 53:28.705
I wonder if she'll drop by
to see the flowers.

53:57.442 --> 54:00.070
JISAN PRISON, JOO YEO-JEONG
MEDICAL OFFICER

54:02.781 --> 54:05.367
Oh, come on.
You're tutoring again, aren't you?

54:05.450 --> 54:08.870
Of course. Revenge isn't cheap.

54:09.621 --> 54:11.373
I'm helping this student
prepare for the exam.

54:14.167 --> 54:15.919
I guess you'll be late every evening?

54:16.002 --> 54:19.381
I picked Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays.
It won't be every evening.

54:20.131 --> 54:23.635
This student's dad is a policy officer
for the Korea Correctional Service.

54:26.721 --> 54:28.807
Well, exams are important.

54:32.143 --> 54:33.311
By the way,

54:34.396 --> 54:36.564
where do you think Jeon Jae-jun went?

54:38.191 --> 54:39.192
I'm not sure.

54:40.527 --> 54:42.779
I guess I wasn't the only person

54:43.738 --> 54:45.740
who wanted to take revenge on him.

55:04.175 --> 55:05.176
Who's there?

55:06.386 --> 55:07.887
Where am I?

55:08.638 --> 55:10.724
Who are you, motherfucker?

55:11.599 --> 55:12.600
Excuse me.

55:14.561 --> 55:16.563
My eyes really hurt right now.

55:17.355 --> 55:18.940
I think I need to see a doctor.

55:19.024 --> 55:20.275
Shit!

55:21.359 --> 55:23.445
It's you, Choi Hye-jeong, isn't it?

55:23.945 --> 55:25.613
Or did she send you?

55:25.697 --> 55:28.950
Hello?
Say something, at least!

55:30.910 --> 55:32.746
Who are you? Huh?

55:33.580 --> 55:35.915
Why are you doing this,
you son of a bitch?

56:30.220 --> 56:31.763
One burner and an unregistered car.

56:32.722 --> 56:36.226
The number's on the back of the phone.
The car's in the parking lot.

56:37.685 --> 56:38.520
Good luck.

56:49.739 --> 56:51.074
What do you need?

56:51.574 --> 56:53.868
I'll have 600 grams of gosari

56:53.952 --> 56:55.787
and two kilos of chwinamul.

56:55.870 --> 56:56.788
Sure.

56:56.871 --> 56:57.872
Mom!

57:02.252 --> 57:03.086
Let's go eat.

57:03.169 --> 57:05.463
I'll rustle something up.
What are you craving?

58:13.364 --> 58:15.867
Looking for a female worker.
Please contact me.

59:19.514 --> 59:21.099
Inmate 3724, transfer.

59:21.182 --> 59:25.812
Let me introduce the teacher who has
volunteered to lead the debate class.

59:38.241 --> 59:39.325
Nice to meet you.

59:39.993 --> 59:42.996
It sounds rather formal
to call it a debate.

59:43.079 --> 59:47.500
Since this class is for those of you
who are scheduled to be released,

59:47.584 --> 59:52.171
this will be more like a book club where
we can freely discuss what we've read.

59:53.006 --> 59:57.343
For those who are willing,
we can try writing resumes and CVs.

01:00:04.225 --> 01:00:07.812
I just got a visit from my younger sister.

01:00:09.606 --> 01:00:11.190
She smiled at me.

01:00:11.274 --> 01:00:13.109
She always used to cry before.

01:00:15.194 --> 01:00:16.279
So thank you.

01:00:17.614 --> 01:00:19.699
Thank you very much, Doctor.

01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:23.786
She still needs
a few more laser treatments,

01:00:23.870 --> 01:00:26.122
but she'll be able to cover it
with makeup now.

01:00:27.123 --> 01:00:29.792
As for you, don't forget
to take your blood pressure pills.

01:00:29.876 --> 01:00:34.005
Right, I can't die
before that bastard stalker does.

01:00:36.049 --> 01:00:39.052
Right. You're in here
for assault, aren't you?

01:00:40.136 --> 01:00:41.971
-So that's what happened.
-Yes.

01:00:43.640 --> 01:00:46.726
I regret that I didn't get to kill
that motherfucker.

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:50.688
You saw the scar yourself.
It was that bastard's doing.

01:00:51.689 --> 01:00:52.940
He did that to her face

01:00:54.484 --> 01:00:55.652
for not dating him.

01:00:57.195 --> 01:00:59.113
Don't worry about your sister.

01:00:59.614 --> 01:01:01.282
I'm pretty good at my other job.

01:01:01.366 --> 01:01:02.784
Oh, yes, of course.

01:01:03.409 --> 01:01:05.244
You don't have to tell me that.

01:01:07.413 --> 01:01:11.834
I heard removing scars
is a very expensive procedure.

01:01:13.086 --> 01:01:17.131
When I get out, I'll do anything,
even manual labor if I have to,

01:01:17.215 --> 01:01:18.883
and pay you back.

01:01:20.009 --> 01:01:22.345
Doctor, I mean it.

01:01:24.681 --> 01:01:26.683
You're a cleaner in Quarter One, right?

01:01:28.601 --> 01:01:31.729
Do you think you could pay me back
with something other than money?

01:01:36.025 --> 01:01:37.026
That's…

01:01:39.153 --> 01:01:40.238
all you want?

01:01:40.947 --> 01:01:42.615
To me, it's worth a fortune.

01:02:40.256 --> 01:02:41.674
Do you want to punish me?

01:02:53.394 --> 01:02:54.228
Yes!

01:02:55.897 --> 01:02:58.399
That's too bad.
I'm already being punished.

01:03:04.363 --> 01:03:05.531
It's not enough.

01:03:07.158 --> 01:03:09.327
And what will make it enough?

01:03:14.373 --> 01:03:15.625
I'll have to kill you.

01:03:16.709 --> 01:03:18.127
And it won't be painless.

01:03:19.462 --> 01:03:20.713
But you're a doctor.

01:03:21.881 --> 01:03:24.884
Isn't there some kind of line
you can't cross?

01:03:28.137 --> 01:03:30.348
I didn't do well at school
but I know that much.

01:03:30.932 --> 01:03:34.143
I know you have some kind of oath
you have to keep.

01:03:46.113 --> 01:03:47.031
You're wrong.

01:03:48.115 --> 01:03:51.536
If I wanted to save animals,
I would've become a vet.

01:03:52.411 --> 01:03:54.914
If I wanted to save the devil,
I would've become a pastor.

01:03:56.707 --> 01:03:58.125
I only save people.

01:03:59.293 --> 01:04:00.419
That oath

01:04:01.796 --> 01:04:04.048
only applies when I'm saving people.

01:04:10.263 --> 01:04:12.682
If, by any chance, we meet again,

01:04:14.267 --> 01:04:15.601
you should be careful.

01:04:17.019 --> 01:04:21.607
The people who walk by you,
the food you eat,

01:04:21.691 --> 01:04:23.609
the pills you take.

01:04:25.278 --> 01:04:27.697
Whatever it is, be careful of everything.

01:04:32.743 --> 01:04:34.328
You're a doctor. You can't do that.

01:04:37.123 --> 01:04:38.207
Don't worry.

01:04:39.625 --> 01:04:41.043
I won't get caught.

01:04:41.961 --> 01:04:43.129
Because I'm a doctor.

01:05:15.870 --> 01:05:19.123
YOON SO-HEE

01:05:20.625 --> 01:05:23.294
Time is finally moving again, So-hee.

01:05:24.587 --> 01:05:25.671
Congratulations.

01:05:26.380 --> 01:05:29.383
We're 19 now, you and me.

01:05:32.261 --> 01:05:36.515
JISAN PRISON

01:06:31.070 --> 01:06:31.988
I love you.

01:06:37.326 --> 01:06:38.494
I love you.

01:09:01.971 --> 01:09:06.976
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
